  "scope": "CPU S2C giant-step accumulation through descending Horner rotations. The LL14 retained replay enables it automatically for retained RNS S2C; --s2c-horner 0 keeps the original path. Non-RNS and uncached fallbacks keep their previous behavior. The generic prepared linear-transform API remains opt-in.",
